<section id="part-1-2"><h3>Part 1.2: Finite Difference Operator</h3>
<p>I apply the same D<sub>x</sub> and D<sub>y</sub> filters to the cameraman image with SciPy. Here I use symmetric boundary extension, which mirrors values at the image border. I combine the derivatives with the gradient magnitude, √(I<sub>x</sub>² + I<sub>y</sub>²), to measure edge strength in either direction.</p>
