</div>
<p>The x derivatives, y derivatives, and gradient magnitudes from the two methods all pass <code>np.allclose</code> in my notebook. Compared with Part 1.2, both methods reduce the grass texture and produce wider, smoother edges. The magnitude images use their own display ranges so the edge structure is visible.</p>
