<h4>Minion and Snoopy</h4>
<p>I resize Snoopy’s image to 1,000 pixels wide and use another similarity transform to place the Minion’s face over Snoopy’s head. I select target points for the Minion’s eyes and use an ellipse centered at (500, 200), with radii 115 and 140 pixels. I blend with the same stack settings.</p>
